@startuml queue_transfer_functions_simple
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title Queue System Transfer Functions - Control Engineering Analysis

' システムコンポーネント定義
component "Camera Input\nu(t)=30fps" as INPUT #LightGreen
component "Queue Controller\nG1(s)" as G1 #LightYellow
component "Queue Buffer\nq1(t)" as B1 #LightYellow
component "TCP Controller\nG2(s)" as G2 #LightCyan
component "WiFi Transmission\nT(s)" as T #LightCyan
component "TCP Reader\nG3(s)" as G3 #LightBlue
component "JPEG Decoder\nG4(s)" as G4 #LightBlue
component "GUI Controller\nG5(s)" as G5 #LightBlue
component "Health Monitor\nH(s)" as H #Gold
component "Reconnection\nR(s)" as R #Gold
component "System Output\ny(t)=6.74fps" as OUTPUT #LightSalmon

' 制御信号フロー
INPUT --> G1 : u(t)
G1 --> B1 : controlled_input
B1 --> G2 : y1(t)
G2 --> T : tcp_signal
T --> G3 : network_data
G3 --> G4 : jpeg_frames
G4 --> G5 : rgb_frames
G5 --> OUTPUT : y(t)

' 健全性制御ループ
G2 --> H : health_data
H --> R : analysis
R --> G2 : reconnect

' システムフィードバック
H -.-> G1 : health_feedback
OUTPUT -.-> INPUT : user_feedback

note top of INPUT
**Input Signal u(t)**
Amplitude: 57±2 KB
Frequency: f0 = 30 Hz
Period: T0 = 33.33 ms
Type: Periodic pulse train
end note

note right of G1
**Transfer Function G1(s)**
G1(s) = K1/(τ1s + 1)
K1 = 1.0 (ideal gain)
τ1 = 33ms (time constant)
Control: FIFO + Saturation
end note

note right of B1
**State Equation**
dq1/dt = u1(t) - y1(t)
Constraint: 0 ≤ q1(t) ≤ 7
Equilibrium: q1* = 1-2 (stable)
Capacity: C1 = 7 frames
end note

note bottom of G2
**TCP Transfer Function G2(s)**
G2(s) = K2·e^(-θs)/(τ2s + 1)
K2 = 0.85 (effective gain)
τ2 = 134ms (time constant)
θ = 10-50ms (variable delay)
Bandwidth: 1.19 Hz
end note

note bottom of T
**WiFi Transmission T(s)**
Bandwidth: BW = 1-2 Mbps
Delay: θ = 5-20ms
Noise: σ² = interference
Saturation: Non-linear
end note

note right of G3
**TCP Reader G3(s)**
Processing: τ3 = 174ms
Buffer: 250KB
Control: Continuous
Parallel: Independent thread
end note

note right of G4
**JPEG Decoder G4(s)**
Processing: τ4 = 2.07ms
Gain: K4 = 1 (lossless)
Control: Asynchronous
Parallel: Independent
end note

note right of G5
**GUI Controller G5(s)**
Control period: T5 = 16.7ms (60fps)
Response: Real-time
Feedback: Frame availability
Target: Smooth display
end note

note bottom of H
**Health Monitor H(s)**
Sampling: Ts = 3s
Target: h_target = 134ms
Filter: Moving average (10pt)
Threshold: h_thresh = 200ms
Control: Adaptive
end note

note bottom of R
**Reconnection Controller R(s)**
Response time: τr = 3s
Control action: ON/OFF
Effect: 90% improvement
Reset: Instant recovery
end note

note bottom of OUTPUT
**System Output Y(s)**
Measured: y(t) = 6.74 fps
Theoretical: y_theo = 5.7 fps
Improvement: +125% vs Phase 7.3.3
Stability: Health guaranteed
end note

@enduml